{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D-93xXQYFjLMfgm8h5EM2g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:24.075612+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D-93xXQYFjLMfgm8h5EM2g","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/W2hP7jwXeIoMIaDJnTv0m48e8Zg9wfZNNcWYj3RXKDVWH9OmODSvG7JmBwxxTEv9tf2mNRZw8BeianOWoUu9sVA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><section><p><strong><span>南京大学工程管理学院</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知</span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>南京大学接收推荐免试研究生预报名系统于2026年8月3日开放， 工程管理学院入口将于2026年8月28日17:00关闭。欢迎各校优秀学子踊跃报名。</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ZezJTWp3h5X7XuYYNAXHajNqNWlggAicTFjMkTeJzHFzhPLhicg1fFWO3GZpEGTkCMU7eibTawHvGVaxxmbfCDbaxsTCYGTYhaLmBRqETdF5pM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>备注：我校推免预报名系统中的直博生招生导师名单仅供初步参考，最终以教育部推免服务系统中公布的 2027 年直博生导师信息为准。请申请推免直博的考生在系统申报时选择相近导师，同时以邮件形式告知准确申报信息。邮件发送至：smezs@nju.edu.cn。建议申请推免直博的考生在报考阶段积极联络，如对报考信息有疑问，可在报名阶段联系咨询。</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2.申请者应为国内重点高校大学在籍三年级学生（2027年7月前毕业）。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>3.综合素质优秀，学习成绩优异，名列前茅，在学术或其他方面有突出表现者可提供证明材料。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>4.英语水平良好。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>5.申请直博者，本科前三学年总学分成绩应名列专业前茅，具有较强的创新意识和学术潜质，外国语达到我单位博士生申请考核细则中的外国语要求。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>6.跨专业申请者应具备所申请专业大学本科阶段应达到的知识能力和水平，并须提供相关证明材料。</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1. “南京大学接收推荐免试研究生预报名系统”登录端口位于南京大学研究</span></strong><strong><span>生</span></strong><strong><span>院主页底部“信息系统”导航栏内，网址为</span></strong><span><strong><span>https://gs.nju.edu.cn/geapp/sys/yjsbmxsd/entrance.do</span><span><span>（</span></span></strong></span><strong><span>以下简称“南大推免系</span></strong><strong><span>统”）选择“推免预报名”系统进入。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2. 有意申报我院2027年推荐免试研究生的同学，必须通过南大推免系统</span></strong><strong><span>预报名成功后，方可获得我院遴选、复试资格；如未通过南大推免系统预报</span></strong><strong><span>名，将被视为无效申请。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3.我院将于9月13日前组织复试，具体事宜另行通知。</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>南京大学工程管理学院</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>2026年8月3日</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZezJ